[h1][b]Added:[/b][/h1]
* 9 achievements (it is recommended to play on a clean save slot);
* Sounds of emerging / disappearing platforms;
* Change of music at the end of the final scene.

[h1][b]Bugs fixed:[/b][/h1]
* After scrolling screens, showing dialogs or character damage, the control was turned off - fixed;
* Fixed location and timings of appearing / disappearing platforms in the city and in the last level;
* Fixed interaction with large boxes (Caves level).
